WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.382
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind communication in our

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:05.853
community.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.948
Mobile phone: allows calls and messages. Radio: broadcasts sound to listeners.

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:17.410
Television: shares moving pictures and sound. Email: sends digital written messages.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.615
Video call: lets distant people see and hear one another.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:27.709
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of mobile phone, radio and

00:00:27.709 --> 00:00:31.090
television. Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
